{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 25,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David Reigns over All Israel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then all the tribes of Israel came to David at Hebron and spoke, saying, “Indeed we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your bone and your flesh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also, in time past, when Saul was king over us, you were the one who led Israel out and brought them in; and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to you, ‘You shall shepherd My people Israel, and be ruler over Israel.’ ” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore all the elders of Israel came to the king at Hebron, and King David made a covenant with them at Hebron before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". And they anointed David king over Israel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "David "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " thirty years old when he began to reign, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he reigned forty years. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In Hebron he reigned over Judah seven years and six months, and in Jerusalem he reigned thirty-three years over all Israel and Judah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Conquest of Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the king and his men went to Jerusalem against the Jebusites, the inhabitants of the land, who spoke to David, saying, “You shall not come in here; but the blind and the lame will repel you,” thinking, “David cannot come in here.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless David took the stronghold of Zion (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the City of David)."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now David said on that day, “Whoever climbs up by way of the water shaft and defeats the Jebusites (the lame and the blind, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hated by David’s soul), "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he shall be chief and captain."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” Therefore they say, “The blind and the lame shall not come into the house.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David dwelt in the stronghold, and called it the City of David. And David built all around from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. The Landfill"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the Millo and inward. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David went on and became great, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of hosts "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Hiram king of Tyre sent messengers to David, and cedar trees, and carpenters and masons. And they built David a house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David knew that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " had established him as king over Israel, and that He had exalted His kingdom for the sake of His people Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David took more concubines and wives from Jerusalem, after he had come from Hebron. Also more sons and daughters were born to David. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the names of those who were born to him in Jerusalem: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shimea, 1 Chr. 3:5"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ibhar, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Elishama, 1 Chr. 3:6"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Elishama, Eliada, and Eliphelet."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Philistines Defeated"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the Philistines heard that they had anointed David king over Israel, all the Philistines went up to search for David. And David heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and went down to the stronghold. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The Philistines also went and deployed themselves in the Valley of Rephaim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David inquired of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", saying, “Shall I go up against the Philistines? Will You deliver them into my hand?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to David, “Go up, for I will doubtless deliver the Philistines into your hand.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David went to Baal Perazim, and David defeated them there; and he said, “The "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has broken through my enemies before me, like a breakthrough of water.” Therefore he called the name of that place "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Master of Breakthroughs"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Baal Perazim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they left their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "idols"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "images there, and David and his men carried them away."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Philistines went up once again and deployed themselves in the Valley of Rephaim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore David inquired of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and He said, “You shall not go up; circle around behind them, and come upon them in front of the mulberry trees. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it shall be, when you hear the sound of marching in the tops of the mulberry trees, then you shall advance quickly. For then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will go out before you to strike the camp of the Philistines.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David did so, as the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " commanded him; and he drove back the Philistines from Geba"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Tg., Vg.; LXX Gibeon"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as far as Gezer."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}